 just change the floors. Do not overdo it though! The better it looks, the more money you make!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1546540/extras/db7ee33ed60ee02559da6cc235f49bab.poster.avif?t=1726661279\" width=610 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1546540/extras/db7ee33ed60ee02559da6cc235f49bab.webm?t=1726661279\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>Invest wisely to achieve maximum profit. Keep an eye out for the best bargain, and strike when you see an opportunity. Are you into risky deals, or you just want to play it safe? The choice is yours!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1546540/extras/fbbfe6d3387af6cdbd906997b8732a27.poster.avif?t=1726661279\" width=610 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1546540/extras/fbbfe6d3387af6cdbd906997b8732a27.webm?t=1726661279\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>Become a landlord and get involved in real-estate. You are the one in the driver's seat. Stay calm, focused and ready to make your bussiness rise all the way to the top!", "about_the_game": "<strong>The Tenants - Free Trial </strong> is a standalone prologue to the game &quot;The Tenants&quot;. It is a free game that includes some features available in the full version.  <br>It includes:<br><br>- Storyline Prologue that explains all the main features<br>- The first district - Slums<br>- The first four archetypes of tenants<br>- Jobs system<br>- Babysitting system<br>- Renting apartments and taking care of your tenants<br>- Ability to renovate flats and apartments<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video c